    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p><p>This musical instrument has 3 charges and regains all expended charges daily at dawn. While playing it, you can take a Magic action to expend 1 charge and write a magical message on a nonmagical object or surface you can see within 30 feet of yourself. The message is up to six words long, in a language you know. If you’re a Bard, the message can have seven more words, and you can make it glow faintly so that it remains visible in nonmagical Darkness. Casting @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDispelMagi]{Dispel Magic} on the message erases it; otherwise, it fades after 24 hours.</p>",
